WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.631
Unpivoting raises a NULL-policy question You can
preserve rows

00:00:05.657 --> 00:00:11.567
whose value is NULL That keeps the category present
and marks the measurement

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:18.143
missing Or you can drop NULL rows after unpivoting
The

00:00:18.170 --> 00:00:22.130
right choice depends on whether missingness itself
matters to the analysis
